WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.560 align:start position:19%
3:30 a.m. The caller ID showed my
mother's number.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:11.160 align:start position:19%
My mother had been dead for 11 years.
So, yes, I answered it.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:18.800 align:start position:19%
It was not my mother. It was a man
breathing hard, counting down from 10.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:23.840 align:start position:19%
At one, he whispered my name.
I am Jack Doyle. 3 years I worked nights

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:31.040 align:start position:19%
at mile 61.
Mile 61 sat off Interstate Subscribe for

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.040 align:start position:19%
